jobs.description:
Are you accurate and do you enjoy working with different materials and machines? For our client in Waalwijk, we are looking for a Production Employee for the Preparation Department. Together with a team of four colleagues, you will transform bulk materials into precisely sized components used in the production of custom-made sandwich panels.

What will you do?

You will work with materials such as foam, wood, and composite. Using production lists, you will cut and calibrate these materials to the required dimensions.

- Adjust materials to the correct thickness using various saws and calibration machines;
- Cut materials to size at your own workstation;
- Calibrate material thickness using a thickness planer;
- Label components according to the production list and sort them onto transport carts;
- Keep your work area clean and organized.

Since every sandwich panel is custom-made, you will work with different production lists and dimensions every day.

What do we expect from you?

- You work accurately and enjoy working as part of a team;
- You can read production lists or are willing to learn;
- You speak Dutch or English.

Company Description:
NOTE: We do not provide visa nor accommodation. Make sure to only apply when you are already residing in the Netherlands.

Novotel Amsterdam City
Novotel Amsterdam City is one of the largest 4‑star hotels in the Netherlands. As a strong and trusted brand within the international Accor group, we offer 610 guest rooms, 1,300 m&sup2; of meeting facilities, and several vibrant F&B outlets. Every day, we welcome more than 500 guests and take pride in delivering the exceptional service they deserve.
Are you service‑minded and ready to take the next step in your hospitality career? Would you like to work in one of the largest hotels in the Benelux, surrounded by a young, spontaneous, and energetic team? Then this is the perfect opportunity for you.
At Novotel Amsterdam City, passion, quality, and professionalism are at the heart of everything we do. With genuine attention and an authentic approach, we ensure that our guests feel welcome and return with pleasure. You will be part of a close‑knit team of around 135 colleagues, where we know each other, support each other, and enjoy our work together.

